#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:6 da4b6c6918a64ce6aed1300d6e017dc7
msgid "ArduPilot Pre-Built Binaries"
msgstr "ArduPilot 预构建二进制文件"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:8 3592a03cda7340cb8846b835bd5ab004
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot firmware server at https://firmware.ardupilot.org has pre-"
"built binaries for many common flight boards."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 固件服务器（https://firmware.ardupilot.org）提供了适用于多种常见飞行控制板的预构建二进制文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:11
#: 62057b80816e4994b12fd0baf70a3150
msgid "Build Categories"
msgstr "构建分类"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:13
#: f5ce9b0fa9a44df9a2151dacfda2ab5b
msgid "For each vehicle type there are 4 categories of pre-built binary:"
msgstr "每种机型提供 4 类预构建二进制文件："

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:15
#: b99b1527255d4ffeaeb4148ae7bf6e31
msgid "stable: the most recent stable release, recommended for normal usage"
msgstr "stable（稳定版）：最新稳定发布版本，推荐日常使用"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:16
#: 4d9cc3af663c480d8728c7420d0aa971
msgid ""
"beta: the most recent beta release, this is for users who wish to help test "
"new features before they go into a stable release"
msgstr "beta（测试版）：最新 beta 发布版本，适合希望在新功能正式发布前参与测试的用户"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:17
#: 74143376bbfc4338ae86f39d70b1640d
msgid ""
"latest: the most recent build of our git master branch, this contains the "
"latest code. Use with caution, this version has undergone very little "
"testing"
msgstr "latest（最新版）：git master 分支的最新构建，包含最新代码。请谨慎使用，该版本经过的测试非常有限"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:18
#: fb0e21f6aa1d4629a9a7302d1cbb08ef
msgid ""
"historical builds: These are older version of the latest builds. These can "
"be used to find when a bug was introduced by trying a range of build dates"
msgstr "historical builds（历史构建）：这些是较旧版本的 latest 构建，可通过尝试不同构建日期来定位 bug 引入时间"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:22
#: 8b27d41101ea4f79811a6d9c7b5ec0a3
msgid "File Types"
msgstr "文件类型"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:24
#: b548a3a354864aeb8c47f8c836a81c65
msgid ""
"Within the build directories you will find files of the following types:"
msgstr "构建目录中可找到以下类型的文件："

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:27
#: 15ff277924c144f18027d21c4a33a7bb
msgid ""
"``*.apj`` files: these are \"ArduPilot JSON\" firmwares, which contain a "
"firmware that can be loaded by ArduPilot compatible ground station software"
msgstr "``*.apj`` 文件：「ArduPilot JSON」格式固件，可由 ArduPilot 兼容的地面站软件加载"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:28
#: f23f3080ed5742b2b44754bb49e89d75
msgid ""
"``*.px4`` files: these are an older name for an apj file, and use the same "
"format"
msgstr "``*.px4`` 文件：apj 文件的旧称，使用相同格式"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:29
#: f576ed0df30347be9adfbfcd37eb5f9f
msgid ""
"``*.hex`` files: these are firmwares in Intel hex format, for loading with "
"DFU loading tools. These are used for boards which don't come with an "
"ArduPilot compatible bootloader"
msgstr "``*.hex`` 文件：Intel hex 格式固件，用于 DFU 烧录工具。适用于未预装 ArduPilot 兼容引导加载程序的板卡"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:31
#: a7540c41599d4837a331ea4fa4b93174
msgid ""
"``*_with_bl.hex`` files: these are variants of the hex files with the "
"bootloader built-in. They can be used to install both the bootloader and "
"ArduPilot vehicle firmware in one step using a DFU loading tool"
msgstr ""
"``*_with_bl.hex`` 文件：内置引导加载程序的 hex 文件变体，可通过 DFU 烧录工具一步安装引导加载程序和 ArduPilot "
"飞行器固件"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:35
#: 0eef34d3dce44db5951d6ca7bbfcaa23
msgid "Build Variants"
msgstr "构建变体"

#: ../../source/docs/pre-built-binaries.rst:37
#: 559338bb68044563b8167f7bf7ea7789
msgid ""
"For some types of flight boards multiple builds in separate directories are "
"provided. For example, you can find a firmware suitable for a Pixhawk2.1 "
"Cube in both the px4-v3 directory and the CubeBlack directory. These "
"variants use different underlying RTOS code (NuttX and ChibiOS). As we move "
"the project away from NuttX to ChibiOS the NuttX builds will be removed over"
" time."
msgstr ""
"某些飞行控制板类型会在不同目录中提供多个构建变体。例如，适用于 Pixhawk2.1 Cube 的固件可在 px4-v3 目录和 CubeBlack "
"目录中找到。这些变体使用不同的底层实时操作系统代码（NuttX 和 ChibiOS）。随着项目从 NuttX 向 ChibiOS 迁移，NuttX "
"构建将逐步移除。"
